$ graphify install --project --platform agents
  references       ->  .agents/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .agents/skills/graphify/SKILL.md

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .agents/

$ graphify agents install
  references       ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.agents/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.agents/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md

Agents will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Agents — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.
